uimiento de manos. Los videos est\u00e1n incluidos en la aplicaci\u00f3n y no requieren un servicio de streaming.", "short_description": "Descubre monta\u00f1as, valles, llanuras y costas en una gran pantalla virtual. Completa cuatro actividades, re\u00fane estampas \u00fanicas y desbloquea el final del \u00c1lbum del Explorador. Una experiencia educativa para un jugador, con narraci\u00f3n e interfaz en espa\u00f1ol, controles Quest y videos incluidos en el dispositivo."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portada-horizontal.png", "id": "2062883984362214", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/831048856_2062883987695547_1770000366938608694_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2RZQhLAQZ-0Q7kNvwHyRHtI&_nc_oc=AdoKM3091Yy1DI8hDA2heslKuF8azBslqqmA2nQQaziFYbCO7By4QHKEbNhOFgZcdnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT7aRjVRtcPE6uO2ZxhyMGSdeEqseiMDcXNcw33IswYCw&oe=6AE89700"}, {"file_name": "portada-vertical.png", "id": "2002624273753644", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/737543484_2002624277086977_3673111185441615117_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E5WXu5f4DoQQ7kNvwHbdiYU&_nc_oc=AdrE7QA9FZ413qmilEgUskaevb0S4IdBI8yXcAYEpBfgljyo88dTnvlQvfCxBJAUYDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSB0we4E9msWd9sPNVkdLS7eEIszP_xrMR8KE4NrlwY0A&oe=6AE891C5"}, {"file_name": "portada-principal.png", "id": "1768137627779634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/646443466_1768137631112967_716579605633656818_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jZiklUgiJ20Q7kNvwGwaU2N&_nc_oc=Adrn-KNcrZ_CTNBjDod9JZ-Pa2BZYabOtpUd6eNDxZsSWwkKFV30m9w0w9C4fk6ohdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRrPCMGSG2fjQIkL9yiUnHnwOJ6eUSnQdI-kzbsessbcg&oe=6AE8B458"}, {"file_name": "icono.png", "id": "16620519920599